Chapter 2B for Prayut Chan-o-cha in 2022 is a limited-exposure, diplomacy-heavy case. The record shows repeated Thai calls for ceasefire, dialogue, humanitarian access, and lawful settlement in Ukraine and Myanmar, alongside a couple of mixed abstentions on Russia-related UN votes. I did not find evidence of Thai participation in external war, proxy conflict, or cross-border aggression in 2022.

